flowchart TD
  Request[Accepted asset task] --> Brief[Artist asks Lead for purpose / accepted fit / moving parts / stage / faceted references]
  Brief --> Decision{Material gameplay or style contradiction?}
  Decision -->|yes| Designer[Lead asks Designer for that decision]
  Designer --> Concept
  Decision -->|no| Concept[Coherent faceted 2D turnaround / preserve compliant approved concepts]
  Concept --> Views[Front / back / left / right / useful three-quarter / top-bottom where shape needs them]
  Views --> Resolve[Resolve contradictory equipment and proportions before modeling]
  Resolve --> Scout[On-demand asset_scout / fixed Luna / explicit dispatch effort]
  Scout --> Local[Inspect existing project viewing references first]
  Local --> Search[One bounded external pass / up to 3-5 viewing references]
  Search --> Shortlist[URLs / creators / visual fit / mismatches / unknowns OR honest no match]
  Shortlist --> Select[Artist selects useful references; no match is not a blocker]
  Select --> Original[Artist authors original model from accepted brief and concept]
  Original --> QA[Proportionate existing asset QA / export / readiness evidence]
  QA --> Handoff[Editable source and export / dimensions / orientation / pivot / actual limits]
  Handoff --> Integrate[Lead integrates under existing permitted checks and required Designer review]
  Prohibited[Viewing references only: no imported mesh / tracing / resculpting / geometry-texture reuse / paid download / purchase]
  Prohibited -.-> Scout
  Paused[Paused new animation and no local engine remain binding]
  Paused -.-> QA
